@startuml RMS_Sequence
actor "Jira Automation" AS Jira
participant "API\n(FastAPI)" as API
participant "Destruct\n(輸入解析)" as Destruct
participant "Verify\n(檢查邏輯)" as Verify
participant "GitLab API" as GitLab
participant "ReportFormat\n(報表產生器)" as Report

Jira -> API : 呼叫 /check_rms_report

API -> Destruct : get_project_list(data)\n解析輸入
Destruct --> API : issue_id, issue_key, project_list

loop 每個專案
    API -> Verify : execute(project)\n開始檢查

    Verify -> GitLab : 取得專案資訊
    GitLab --> Verify : 專案資料

    group 檢查流程
        Verify -> Verify : 分支檢查
        Verify -> Verify : Pipeline 檢查
        Verify -> Verify : CI 設定檢查
    end
    Verify --> API : ProjectReport
end

API -> Report : generate_report(project_output_list)
Report --> API : 檢查報告 (Text)

API --> Jira : PlainTextResponse
@enduml
